{"posts":[{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F43mhD3j&urlhash=oncG&mt=mTu7pY9UQpG3kwe6uVreqqoSDZq7X1uaD64qEBwPn6TBdDtExzKxodaGdjxosG5yvnwPzwEK0GVrQDtPjcwiqmgKs295YnhTPqhmq8x_bqLwfiM7ruXQRC9m7TM&isSdui=true","authorName":"Enzigma","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/enzigma/posts/","jobTitle":"Company","company":"Enzigma","location":"","postText":"Onboarding shouldn't require more people. It should require fewer manual steps. A new client fills out one form. What happens next can trigger the CRM, e-signature, account application, and compliance workflow automatically. Our latest WealthTech Advisor Insights explores how advisory firms can automate client onboarding using the tools they already own and give their team more time back. 📩 See how Enzigma helps wealth advisory firms connect and automate their existing technology: https://bit.ly/43mhD3j \"We build the tech. You build the wealth.\" -Hemanshu Shah, CEO, Enzigma #WealthManagement #RIA #ClientOnboarding #Automation","reactionCount":4,"commentCount":3,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anuska-mahapatra-legal/","username":"Anuska Mahapatra","value":"digital onboarding is a game-changer, but how do you ensure compliance without losing the personal touch that many clients still value? it's a tricky balance to strike","time":"","comment_reply_to_user_url":null}]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/beyond-audit-why-modern-law-firms-re-engineering-client-onboarding-gjchf/","authorName":"Verifi360","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/verifi360/posts/","jobTitle":"Company","company":"Verifi360","location":"","postText":"Compliance doesn't have to mean friction. Here's why forward-thinking law firms are ditching manual paperwork for instant digital onboarding and zero local data liability. Read the full article here Beyond the Audit: Why Modern Law Firms Are Re-Engineering Client Onboarding","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flandingrabbit%2Ecom&urlhash=ImSU&mt=rzNBfxc6WZGyKMnuJ4lYx4beu5I3fIjGRJhqLN027qpHXMC10vIcvt6CSeLcsYr4bpLTTICw_oHEQpWqw4OsIE2MRlh8UL7FC_7Us5BZ_g&isSdui=true","authorName":"Toni Hopponen","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tonihopponen/","jobTitle":"Founder","company":"LandingRabbit","location":"","postText":"I run a super high-touch onboarding now to build the best possible self-serve experience later. It's something I learned from mistakes with my previous SaaS. Instead of doing the manual work and onboarding one by one at the start, we were improving the app based on the free trial usage data. Eventually, we scaled to thousands of paying clients via self-serve, but it took a long time to get there (and we burnt quite a bit of cash to get enough sign ups). === Now, I run 15-30 minute interviews with founders and build their homepage together. One interview gives me so much more insight than a lot of free trial sign ups and their usage data could ever give. === With LandingRabbit, we are trying to tackle multiple challenges at once: 1️⃣ What should my homepage say and what other pages do I need? 2️⃣ How should my pages look? 3️⃣ How do I make updates and new content creation a habit? Finding the best possible self-serve flow ain't gonna be an overnight thing. But after every high-touch onboarding and applying learnings into the app, we are a tiny bit closer to the self-serve dream.","reactionCount":12,"commentCount":6,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/%E2%93%96-avais-s-b84a4248/","username":"ⓖ Avais S.","value":"The interview bit is the part most people skip. Usage data tells you what someone did, never why they sat staring at their headline for ten minutes. How many of those 15-30 min calls did you get through before the same answers started coming back?","time":"","comment_reply_to_user_url":null},{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tonihopponen/","username":"Toni Hopponen","value":"always learning tbh 👍","time":"","comment_reply_to_user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/%E2%93%96-avais-s-b84a4248/"},{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aounmuhammad18/","username":"Aoun Muhammad","value":"This is such a smart approach. I think direct conversations with users can teach you things that analytics alone often miss. Doing the work manually in the beginning might not feel scalable, but it gives you a much deeper understanding of what people actually struggle with. Those insights can then help build a much better self serve experience later. Sometimes the fastest way to scale is to slow down and learn from your users first.","time":"","comment_reply_to_user_url":null}]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Ezenithr%2Ecom%2Fall-request-demo&urlhash=Fxiw&mt=_zgDZH_1MT_MvkaxTYLfT_3puLBS6iqFtqvOpR_GgEPq4Vp02lCGA7NRNA6blNOQKYxHZGjWCQCSHEId0C0IRmpXZk6u&isSdui=true","authorName":"Zenithr","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/zenithr/posts/","jobTitle":"Company","company":"Zenithr","location":"","postText":"A new employee doesn't just need access to systems. They need to understand the role, know what success looks like, feel connected to the team, and have the confidence to contribute. Because ticking every box doesn't automatically create a great employee experience. Know in this edition of HR talks how a great onboarding plan works and the steps to applying it to your workforce. Onboarding Plans That Work: The 30-60-90-Day Framework","reactionCount":17,"commentCount":2,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmadegicmedia%2Ecom%2F&urlhash=SX6w&mt=s-fVaO3j9Yx4utAiPX8PCc5tpkPXktV_DvnkFhfSeR-mMOS-Z0LEc3cKBL0QEkrhYHVbXNoviWT2j2ZrIKVsGN1GOURUnRcgM-JDsv9I1pxk&isSdui=true","authorName":"Bradley Jonkers","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bradley-jonkers/","jobTitle":"Founder","company":"Madegic Media","location":"","postText":"The retention that starts on day one. You can't build loyalty in month 6. You build it on day 1. The moment a client signs, they're already asking: \"Did I make the right choice?\" Your onboarding experience is their answer. Smooth, organised, clear, responsive? \"Yes, I made the right choice.\" Chaotic, slow, confusing, unresponsive? \"Maybe I should have gone with the other firm.\" Automated client onboarding guarantees the first response: ✓ Welcome that explains exactly what happens next ✓ Forms that are easy to complete (digital, not faxed) ✓ Timeline they can reference anytime ✓ Updates without them having to ask ✓ Transparency that builds confidence Retention isn't about doing big things. It's about nailing small things consistently. From day one. #PersonalInjuryLaw #ClientCare #Retention","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdriptick%2Ecom%2Fblog%2Fcreate-a-client-onboarding-form-that-clients-actually-complete%2F&urlhash=jhYU&mt=3FjPcgc9SeXVqdxSWGgkzbNKwvXXETztNCNk1UpTtshWh85ATi6YgfI-Yjv3ZOCvyvBzzsdpvvVT5Hc91wFjo0bBrJPPEaKxOA5Z3YBZDQe9UsUglSknVVqQQVg&isSdui=true","authorName":"DripTick","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/driptick/posts/","jobTitle":"Company","company":"DripTick","location":"","postText":"A client onboarding form sounds simple. You make a list of questions, put them into a form builder, send the link to your new client, and wait for the answers. Except that's usually where things go wrong. The form gets longer. More questions get added. Someone remembers another piece of information they need. Then another. Eventually, the client opens the form and sees what feels like a small administrative project waiting for them. So they close it. You send a reminder. They say they'll get to it. A few days later, you send another reminder. And suddenly your \"streamlined onboarding process\" has created exactly the email back-and-forth you were trying to eliminate. A good client onboarding form should do something different. It should help you start the project with clarity while making it easy for the client to provide what you need. The goal isn't to ask every possible question.... #form #forms #formbuilder #pagebuilder #onboarding #client #user #communication https://lnkd.in/dDJMfpYx","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/employee-onboarding-first-90-days-can-shape-employees-anand-tiwari-86oif/","authorName":"Anand Tiwari","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anand-tiwari-81388a186/","jobTitle":"HR Enthusiast","company":"","location":"","postText":"Employee Onboarding: The First 90 Days Can Shape an Employee's Journey","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F43mhD3j&urlhash=oncG&mt=mTu7pY9UQpG3kwe6uVreqqoSDZq7X1uaD64qEBwPn6TBdDtExzKxodaGdjxosG5yvnwPzwEK0GVrQDtPjcwiqmgKs295YnhTPqhmq8x_bqLwfiM7ruXQRC9m7TM&isSdui=true","authorName":"Anil Mohite","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anil-mohite-105534b8/","jobTitle":"HR Executive","company":"","location":"","postText":"🚀 Employee Onboarding: The First Step Towards Employee Success An employee's journey with an organization starts from the moment they receive the offer—not on their first working day. A smooth onboarding process can make employees feel welcomed, valued, and confident from Day 1. 🤝 As HR Operations professionals, some key onboarding responsibilities include: ✅ Documentation & background verification ✅ HRMS/HRIS data creation ✅ Attendance & leave setup ✅ Payroll information collection ✅ Policy communication ✅ Introduction to the team & workplace ✅ Ensuring a smooth Day 1 experience A well-structured onboarding process doesn't just complete formalities—it builds trust and creates a positive employee experience. 💡 Good onboarding creates good first impressions. Great onboarding creates long-term engagement. What is the most important part of onboarding according to you? #HROperations #EmployeeOnboarding #HumanResources #HR #EmployeeExperience #HRProfessionals #HRManagement #WorkplaceCulture","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":1,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivani-chaudhary-bbb229421/","username":"Shivani Chaudhary","value":"I'm interested please Connect me 9811695765 because i have experience","time":"4d","comment_reply_to_user_url":null}]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flnkd%2Ein%2FgQSTWjmA&urlhash=pZSL&mt=eO8XjQl0FEoX6uRcdzcxV6bvJna858j6-wJ1purJoxs83HzCqFOHkL-EKeiBgmGwkiQ5R5jfLUFgHWecs4oEPcuG5xOgRo6UMNFY_qSdsm5utFEyI4KNcZMkmIU&isSdui=true","authorName":"Cyrus Santiago","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyrus-santiago/","jobTitle":"AI Visibility & AI Implementation Consultant","company":"","location":"Philippine-Based","postText":"small business AI automation blueprint 🚨 Stop trading 60 hours a week for tasks a simple workflow could handle before your morning coffee finishes brewing. Most business owners treat artificial intelligence like a shiny party trick. They generate a few cool images, ask a chatbot to rewrite a polite email, and call it a day. Meanwhile, the actual operational weight (the tedious client onboarding, manual reporting, and fragmented schedules) keeps burning away their weekends. The shift happening right now isn't about working harder or hiring larger teams. It is about building smart operational loops that run silently in the background. Here is what changes when you implement an AI blueprint designed for real-world operations: Reclaimed Focus: Reclaim 10+ hours every week by turning multi-step administrative routines into automated single triggers. Frictionless Onboarding: Standardize client intakes and data routing without manual data entry errors. Scalable Systems: Build leverage directly into your daily routine so your business handles double the volume without doubling your stress. If you are ready to stop acting as the human middleware in your own company, this quick breakdown maps out the entire transition step by step. Read here: https://lnkd.in/gQSTWjmA What is the one repetitive task in your business that you wish you could delegate to an automated system today? #SmallBusinessAI #AIAutomation #BusinessProductivity #WorkflowOptimization #Entrepreneurship #OperationsStrategy #DigitalTransformation","reactionCount":1,"commentCount":1,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[{"interaction_type":"comment","user_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/asifejaz-ai/","username":"Asif Ejaz","value":"Mostly agree, though 10 hours reclaimed is only real if the automation does not create a new job of watching the automation. The failure I keep seeing is a flow that quietly stops and nobody notices for two weeks. Monitoring belongs in the deliverable, not as an extra.","time":"2w","comment_reply_to_user_url":null}]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbit%2Ely%2F43mhD3j&urlhash=oncG&mt=mTu7pY9UQpG3kwe6uVreqqoSDZq7X1uaD64qEBwPn6TBdDtExzKxodaGdjxosG5yvnwPzwEK0GVrQDtPjcwiqmgKs295YnhTPqhmq8x_bqLwfiM7ruXQRC9m7TM&isSdui=true","authorName":"Kishore Avulapati","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kishore-avulapati-6b50b0330/","jobTitle":"Operations & Compliance Analyst","company":"","location":"","postText":"📘 Client Onboarding – The First Step in Building a Trusted Customer Relationship Client onboarding is more than just collecting customer information and documents. It is the starting point for understanding who the customer is, what they need, and what risks may be associated with the relationship. A simple onboarding journey: ➡️ Customer Information ➡️ Document Collection ➡️ KYC Verification ➡️ Risk Assessment ➡️ Account Activation Good onboarding helps organizations reduce risk, improve customer experience, and build trust from day one. 💡 What do you think is the most important step in client onboarding? #ClientOnboarding #KYC #AML #Compliance #FinancialServices #RiskManagement #BankingOperations #FinancialCrime #LinkedInLearning","reactionCount":1,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"manual client onboarding","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7500468820050993152/","authorName":"TraceTxn","authorUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tracetxn/posts/","jobTitle":"Company","company":"TraceTxn","location":"","postText":"Why are agencies using 5 different tools to manage one client? Onboarding in one place. Communication in another. Projects somewhere else. Approvals on WhatsApp. Handoff through email. 😵‍💫 It gets messy really fast. TraceTxn brings the whole client journey into one place, from onboarding to handoff. Client communication in one place. Files and notes aligned with the client timeline. One complete client profile with all records. Payments, consents, and reminders in the same system. One client. One system. TraceTxn. #TraceTxn #ClientManagement #AgencyLife #AgencyManagement #ClientExperience #ProjectManagement #SaaS","reactionCount":1,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]}]}


