{"posts":[{"topicId":"1","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/property-care-uncertain-world-why-remote-owners-need-structured-clr1c/","authorName":"Indravadan Vala","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"","company":"DwellUpkeep Management LLP","location":"","postText":"Over time, I have come to believe that effective property management is not just about responding when something goes wrong. It is about creating visibility, accountability and structured supervision before problems become bigger. This is one of the reasons we place strong emphasis on Property Care & Management at @DwellUpkeep Management LLP. Our approach focuses on helping property owners stay informed and connected with their assets through structured supervision, inspections, maintenance coordination, tenant and housekeeping management, vendor supervision, renovation and construction monitoring, documentation and regular reporting. I recently shared a deeper perspective on this topic in our latest LinkedIn Article published by @DwellUpkeep Management LLP. \"Property Care in an Uncertain World: Why Remote Property Owners Need Structured Property Supervision\". For property owners managing assets remotely, the question isn't only: \"Who will look after my property?\" It should also be: \"How will I know what is happening with my property?\" That distinction matters.","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"2","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/lift-portfolio-management-lpm/posts/","authorName":"Lift Portfolio Management - LPM","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"","company":"Lift Portfolio Management - LPM","location":"","postText":"What does \"comprehensive\" actually mean in a lift maintenance contract? It doesn't necessarily mean everything is covered. A comprehensive agreement still has inclusions and exclusions, and it is the second list that often determines what arrives as an extra invoice later. Two agreements can both be described as comprehensive and cover quite different things. Call-outs. After-hours attendance. Minor parts. Damage caused by others. Major components such as controllers, drives, ropes and door operators. Depending on the agreement that was signed, these can be treated very differently. The problem is that the word comprehensive sounds complete. So the exclusions often don't get much attention until an invoice arrives that doesn't look like it belongs. By then, the conversation is about one charge rather than the agreement behind it. Here's a check you can do without us.","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"3","postUrl":"","authorName":"Neha Panchal","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"Assistant Manager – Human Resources | Training & Development | Talent Management","company":"","location":"Noida","postText":"WE ARE HIRING – MAINTENANCE MANAGER. Position: Maintenance Manager. Experience: 10+ Years. Location: Noida. Salary: Negotiable. Lead and manage the entire Maintenance Department. Take complete responsibility for the department's day-to-day operations. Plan, supervise, and coordinate all maintenance activities. Lead the maintenance team and ensure effective allocation of work. Ensure timely preventive and breakdown maintenance of machinery/equipment.","reactionCount":141,"commentCount":13,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"4","postUrl":"","authorName":"Manash Dipan Pahi","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"M.Tech in Mechanical Engineering ||Project-Caster||Mechanical Utility|| Materials science","company":"","location":"","postText":"Effective Maintenance Starts with Proper Planning & Control. A well-structured maintenance system is the foundation of reliable plant performance.","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"5","postUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/why-do-we-spend-millions-maintenance-still-have-unexpected-uzgef/","authorName":"Yosra Hoveizavy","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"CEO at SeaMaster Co | SeaTrade Maritime 20 Under 40 Finalist 2025 ; Ex IMO GOODWILL MARITIME AMBASSADOR - 4 YEARS | Bridging the gap between sea and software — making maritime management less stormy, more smart.","company":"SeaMaster Co","location":"","postText":"Do you think a high maintenance budget automatically means a more reliable vessel? I don't! Across many fleets, recurring defects, repeated spare consumption, rising repair costs and machinery downtime can continue even when maintenance plans are being followed. That is why I believe shipowners should look beyond how much is being spent and ask a more important question: is that spending actually improving vessel reliability? I shared this article because better maintenance decisions start with better visibility into the patterns behind the work orders. I'd be interested to hear from shipowners, technical managers and superintendents: What indicator do you trust most when judging whether your maintenance strategy is really working?","reactionCount":13,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]},{"topicId":"6","postUrl":"","authorName":"Lekita D","authorUrl":"","jobTitle":"HR Executive at Licious | Talent Acquisition | Learning & Development (L&D) | Payroll & HR Operations | Employee Engagement | People Analytics","company":"Licious","location":"Hyderabad","postText":"WE'RE HIRING | MAINTENANCE LEAD – HYDERABAD PC. Keep Things Running. Drive Excellence. Build What's Next. Are you a hands-on Maintenance professional who thrives on solving problems, minimizing downtime, and ensuring smooth plant operations?","reactionCount":0,"commentCount":0,"discoveredAt":"2026-09-03","interactions":[]}]}


